        "id": 1042638
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-27T18:27:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There exist `audio_utils_accumulate_energy` which calculates energy per channel: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:system/media/audio_utils/include/audio_utils/power.h;l\u003d84;drc\u003d6386d8fa0d25d78b9239baa221f64cca84e8f36c. There is no similar `audio_utils_compute_power` for the moment, but if it were added I would expect it to be similar in action to `audio_utils_accumulate_energy`.\n\nAlso, technically `audio_utils_compute_power_mono` does calculate power for a single channel. It\u0027s just our understanding that due to how multichannel audio is represented and how energy calculation is defined, it is also possible to use it for non-mono layouts.",
      "parentUuid": "a90f0727_72e8c181",
